use crate::phase8::tenant_context::*;

struct Tenant {
    tenant_id: String,
    name: String,
    api_key: String,
    created_at: String,
    status: String,    // "active" | "inactive" | "suspended"
    quota: ResourceQuota
}

trait TenantCl { ... }

struct TenantManager {
    tenants: Vec<Tenant>,
    active_count: i32,
    next_tenant_num: i32
}

trait TenantManagerCl { ... }
```

함수 전략:
- `create_tenant(name: String, api_key: String) -> Tenant`: `tenant_id: "tenant-001"` 형태로 시퀀스 생성은 외부에서 주입, `status: "active"`, `quota: create_resource_quota(...)`
- `add_tenant(manager: TenantManager, tenant: Tenant) -> TenantManager`: Vec 루프 복사 후 push, `active_count + 1`, `next_tenant_num + 1`
- `find_tenant_by_key(manager: TenantManager, api_key: String) -> String`: Vec 순회하며 `tenant.api_key == api_key` 일치 시 `tenant_id` 반환, 없으면 `""`
