- `deactivate_tenant(manager: TenantManager, tenant_id: String) -> TenantManager`: status를 `"inactive"`로 변경한 새 Vec 구성
- `list_active_tenants_json(manager: TenantManager) -> String`: status == "active" 필터 후 JSON 배열

Tenant JSON 직렬화 패턴:
```
fn tenant_to_json(tenant: Tenant) -> String {
    let mut json = String::new();
    json.push_str("{\"tenant_id\":\"");
    json.push_str(tenant.tenant_id.as_str());
    json.push_str("\",\"name\":\"");
    json.push_str(tenant.name.as_str());
    json.push_str("\",\"status\":\"");
    json.push_str(tenant.status.as_str());
    json.push_str("\",\"quota\":");
    json.push_str(quota_to_json(tenant.quota).as_str());
    json.push_str("}");
    json
}
```

